# Tavro security and cache headers for Cloudflare Pages / Workers static assets.
# Source: docs/PHONE_ACCESS.md section 4. Runbook: docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
#
# NOT shipped by the build. This file deliberately lives outside apps/web/public
# so it can't reach a host before deployment is authorized (D-005, D-017).
# At deploy time it is copied into apps/web/dist/ (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, step 7),
# and `npm run check:dist` then verifies the copy matches this template.
#
# CSP starts as Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: violations are logged to the
# browser DevTools console but nothing is blocked, and there is no report-uri, so
# no violation data leaves the browser. Switch to enforcing only after the manual
# browser check in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md step 9 shows no violations in Demo mode and
# Supabase mode (sign-in, Realtime, every route, light and dark theme): rename the
# header to "Content-Security-Policy", keep the value unchanged, redeploy, re-check.
# Expected console note while Report-Only: browsers ignore upgrade-insecure-requests
# in a report-only policy. That is harmless; the site is HTTPS-only anyway.
#
# script-src 'self' needs no hash: the pre-paint theme script is public/theme-init.js.
# connect-src allows any *.supabase.co project because BYOS means the project URL
# isn't known at build time; Supabase custom domains are therefore unsupported.
# Never add loopback origins here; they belong only in dev and preview.
#
# Do not set Cache-Control under /*: Cloudflare joins values when several rules
# match, which would corrupt the /assets/* rule.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co wss://*.supabase.co; manifest-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# The app shell. Cloudflare serves "/" for index.html and uses the shell for SPA
# fallback on deep links; whether this rule applies to fallback responses is
# unverified, so step 9 checks Cache-Control on a deep link with curl -I.
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/theme-init.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
